    <item>
      <headword id="idp115475304">osan</headword>
      <description>[ɔsɑ̃ṉ] Notes: (1) hole in lobster. (2) trouser leg.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp115473144">poit</headword>
      <description>Quotation: a’ poiteadh [pɔitʹəɣ]. Notes: used when talking about mending ragged old clothes; “patching up”.</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <headword id="idp115468608">cuaran</headword>
      <description>Quotation: pl. [ku̜əɾɑ̃nʹ]. Notes: bandages on hands or feet. Also used of wrapping on hands when gutting herring.</description>
